    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for encryption backends. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enables pluggable encryption implementations:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>gocryptfs (filesystem-level encryption)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>fscrypt (Linux ext4/f2fs encryption)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>encfs (older FUSE-based encryption)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Custom implementations </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
